c8626e55d52c6a8de179df7276202fb62c6a82e1f78a585635dc82fa962c977f1b90bbdbcad156e9e70efcf93ba7f3d77ba58593d5ce2bf7c22dc3f2e71bf7c8  0001-translate-fall-back-to-the-firmware-path-without-remoteproc.patch
